<title>AUSTRIA: BIATHLON-MEN'S 20KM POSTPONED TO FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>BIATHLON-MEN'S 20KM POSTPONED TO FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ROSENAU-WINDISCHGARSTEN, Austria 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A men's 20 km race at the European biathlon championships was called off on Thursday due to heavy overnight rain at the Austrian resort.</p>
<p>Organisers have postponed the event to Friday.</p>
<p>Other championships events are scheduled for Saturday and Sunday.</p>
